<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Large-Scale VLM Chain-of-Thought Prompts</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Prompt variations used in the 1000-way multiple-choice question answering on Attack Bard. “&lt;LABEL SET&gt;" refers to the randomly arranged correct answer and distractor labels.</p>
</div>
